{"seq":3,"slug":"gqa-mqa-cache","title":"GQA/MQA 与缓存缩减","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/kv-cache-optimization/compression/gqa-mqa-cache","wordCount":1347,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gqa-mqa-与缓存缩减\">GQA/MQA 与缓存缩减</h1><p>前面的量化和驱逐都是&quot;模型已经训好了，推理时再想办法压缓存&quot;。这一篇讲的是更釜底抽薪的一招：在设计模型的时候，就让它的 KV 缓存天生小一个数量级。2026 年你能叫得出名字的旗舰开源模型——Llama-4、Qwen、Mistral、DeepSeek、Gemma——无一例外都用了这类架构。它们动的是显存公式里那个最狠的因子：键值头数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>回顾<a href=\"../foundations/memory-accounting\">显存账与瓶颈</a>的公式，KV 缓存正比于<strong>键值头数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。标准多头注意力（MHA）里每个查询头都配一套自己的 K/V 头，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等于查询头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。GQA/MQA 的想法极简：让多个查询头<strong>共享</strong>同一套 K/V 头，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≪</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{kv} \\ll h_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，缓存按比例缩小。</p>\n<p>三种方案是一条连续光谱上的点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>键值头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>KV 缓存相对 MHA</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MHA（多头）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 64）</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>早期 GPT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GQA（分组）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>（如 8）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g/h_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 12.5%）</td>\n<td>接近 MHA</td>\n<td>Llama-3/4、Qwen、Mistral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MQA（多查询）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/h_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 1.6%）</td>\n<td>略降</td>\n<td>PaLM、早期方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLA（低秩潜在）</td>\n<td>— 走压缩路线</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>优于 MHA</td>\n<td>DeepSeek-V2/V3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GQA 是 MHA 和 MQA 之间的可调插值：分组数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 越小越省显存、越接近 MQA，越大越接近 MHA 的质量。实践证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 左右就能在显存与质量间取得极佳平衡，这也是为什么它成了 2026 年的事实标准（来源：GQA 综述，generalcompute.com / zeroentropy.dev）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种共享方式的结构\">三种共享方式的结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[查询头 Q1..Q8] --&gt; B{K/V 共享策略}&#10;  B --&gt;|MHA 每头独立| C[8 个 Q 各配 8 套 KV&lt;br/&gt;缓存最大]&#10;  B --&gt;|GQA 分组共享| D[8 个 Q 分 2 组&lt;br/&gt;每组共享 1 套 KV]&#10;  B --&gt;|MQA 全共享| E[8 个 Q 共享 1 套 KV&lt;br/&gt;缓存最小]&#10;  C --&gt; F[质量基线 显存高]&#10;  D --&gt; G[质量接近 显存中]&#10;  E --&gt; H[质量略降 显存极低]\">flowchart TD\n  A[查询头 Q1..Q8] --&gt; B{K/V 共享策略}\n  B --&gt;|MHA 每头独立| C[8 个 Q 各配 8 套 KV&lt;br/&gt;缓存最大]\n  B --&gt;|GQA 分组共享| D[8 个 Q 分 2 组&lt;br/&gt;每组共享 1 套 KV]\n  B --&gt;|MQA 全共享| E[8 个 Q 共享 1 套 KV&lt;br/&gt;缓存最小]\n  C --&gt; F[质量基线 显存高]\n  D --&gt; G[质量接近 显存中]\n  E --&gt; H[质量略降 显存极低]</pre><p>GQA 的精妙在于：注意力的&quot;查询&quot;部分保留多样性（每个查询头仍独立，捕捉不同模式），只在&quot;被查询&quot;的 K/V 部分做共享。直觉上，多个查询头从同一份 K/V 里取不同侧重的信息，损失的表达力远小于直接砍查询头。这就是它能逼近 MHA 质量、却把缓存砍到 1/8 的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mla-换一条路压缩\">MLA：换一条路压缩</h2><p>DeepSeek 的多头潜在注意力（MLA）走了和 GQA 不同的哲学。GQA 是&quot;少存几套 K/V&quot;（减少头数），MLA 是&quot;把 K/V 压成低秩潜在向量再存&quot;（压缩内容）。具体地，它把每个 token 的 K/V 联合投影到一个低维潜在空间，缓存里只存这个小小的潜在向量，用时再上投影还原。</p>\n<p>这种低秩联合压缩让 MLA 的缓存比 GQA 还小，而据 DeepSeek 报告，质量甚至优于标准 MHA——因为低秩瓶颈起到了某种正则作用（来源：DeepSeek-V2，arxiv.org/pdf/2405.04434）。MLA 正是 DeepSeek-V3/R1 能以可控成本支撑长上下文推理的关键。它和<a href=\"kv-quantization\">KV 量化</a>异曲同工——都是&quot;压缩存储内容&quot;，区别在 MLA 是架构内建的低秩压缩、训练时就定型，量化是事后的低比特映射，两者甚至可以叠加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一笔对比账\">一笔对比账</h2><p>把抽象比例落到<a href=\"../foundations/memory-accounting\">显存账与瓶颈</a>里的 Llama-3 70B 那个例子，假设 64 查询头、每头维 128、80 层、FP16，单 token 单请求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MHA</strong>（64 个 KV 头）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.56</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 80 \\times 64 \\times 128 \\times 2 = 2.56</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.56</span></span></span></span></span> MB</li>\n<li><strong>GQA</strong>（8 个 KV 头）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>320</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 80 \\times 8 \\times 128 \\times 2 = 320</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">320</span></span></span></span></span> KB —— 缩到 1/8</li>\n<li><strong>MQA</strong>（1 个 KV 头）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> KB —— 缩到 1/64</li>\n</ul>\n<p>128K 上下文下，MHA 要 320 GB、GQA 只要 40 GB——这个 8 倍差距，往往就是&quot;长上下文能不能跑起来&quot;的分水岭。也正因为 GQA 已把基数压下来，量化、驱逐这些事后手段才在一个合理的基线上叠加生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其它手段的关系-架构是地基\">与其它手段的关系：架构是地基</h2><p>GQA/MQA/MLA 和本章前两篇有本质区别：它们在<strong>训练时就定型</strong>，推理时无法更改——你不能把一个 MHA 模型变成 GQA。所以它属于&quot;选型/训练阶段的决策&quot;，是后续一切推理优化的地基：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它先把缓存基数压到 1/8（GQA）或更低（MLA），<a href=\"kv-quantization\">KV 量化</a>和<a href=\"kv-eviction-sparsity\">驱逐与稀疏</a>再在此之上各压一刀，乘起来收益巨大。</li>\n<li>它让<a href=\"../memory/paged-attention\">分页注意力</a>管理的缓存池天然更小，同样显存能塞更多并发。</li>\n<li>选模型时，键值头配置应作为推理成本的一等指标——同等参数量，GQA/MLA 模型的部署成本可能差几倍。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换言之：架构选对了，后面的优化是锦上添花；架构选错了（比如老式 MHA），后面再怎么压也吃力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GQA/MQA/MLA 直接动显存公式里最狠的因子——键值头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在训练时就让缓存变小。</li>\n<li>GQA 让多查询头共享少量 K/V 头，是 MHA 与 MQA 之间的可调插值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 是质量与显存的甜点，2026 旗舰模型标配。</li>\n<li>MQA 全共享、缓存最小但质量略降；MLA 走低秩潜在压缩，缓存比 GQA 还小且质量可优于 MHA。</li>\n<li>Llama-3 70B 例子：GQA 把单 token 缓存从 2.56MB 压到 320KB（1/8），128K 上下文从 320GB 降到 40GB。</li>\n<li>架构是地基、训练时定型、推理不可改，量化与驱逐在其上叠加；选模型时键值头配置应作为推理成本一等指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../foundations/memory-accounting\">显存账与瓶颈</a>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因子的来源）、<a href=\"kv-quantization\">KV 量化</a>（可叠加的事后压缩）、<a href=\"../memory/paged-attention\">分页注意力</a>（更小缓存让池子塞更多并发）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../model-compression-inference/inference-optimization/kvcache-and-batching\">模型压缩与推理 · KV 缓存与批处理</a> 从模型压缩视角看架构级缓存缩减。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GQA/MQA 与缓存缩减","id":"gqa-mqa-与缓存缩减"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种共享方式的结构","id":"三种共享方式的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"MLA：换一条路压缩","id":"mla-换一条路压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"一笔对比账","id":"一笔对比账"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它手段的关系：架构是地基","id":"与其它手段的关系-架构是地基"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"驱逐与稀疏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/kv-cache-optimization/compression/kv-eviction-sparsity"},"next":{"title":"KV 卸载与分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/kv-cache-optimization/practice/kv-offloading"}}